{"ok":true,"provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","battle_judgement":{"singleton_contract_reachability":{"join_battle":{"decision":"join_battle","emotion":"resolved","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"格伦已入伍、有主武器，且守备官命令他拿长杆到主厅与艾达会合。他目睹敌袭，虽非战斗专长但责任感强，认为装备使用者应亲自验证装备在实战中的表现。allowed_decisions只有join_battle，故选择参战。"},"avoid_battle":{"decision":"avoid_battle","emotion":"tense","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"马塞尔是非战斗人员，没有武器，已按守备官指令在小教堂避敌。他听到敌袭警报但未亲历伤害，作为神父倾向于留在安全处安抚他人而非逃离。allowed_decisions只有avoid_battle，故选择继续避战。"},"continue_fighting":{"decision":"continue_fighting","emotion":"resolved","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"艾达是老兵副官，责任感强，当前伤势虽重但未到守备官划定的撤退界线；两名友军仍在侧翼，敌人也已重伤，局势尚可支撑。她选择继续战斗。"},"escape_station":{"decision":"escape_station","emotion":"desperate","should_start_escape":true,"morale_delta_intent":-2,"debug_reason":"托马被重创至18HP（低于30%阈值），身边无友军掩护，五名敌人包围。守备官命令不准后退，但托马长期记忆显示守备官前后承诺冲突，且其性格谨慎、不爱逞强，当前处境已无胜算，选择逃离驿站以保全性命。"},"inspired":{"decision":"inspired","emotion":"resolved","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"格伦虽首次跌破30%血量，但自制盾牌成功挡住冲击，艾达已到侧翼，最后一名敌人重伤；守备官指令明确且信任其盾牌作用。铁匠的责任感与对装备使用者的保护欲转化为斗志，选择继续战斗。"}},"full_three_way_actual":{"decision":"continue_fighting","emotion":"resolved","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"艾达是老兵副官，责任感强，当前仍有24血且持盾剑，守备官命令是‘再守一阵’而非撤退；格伦倒地但托马仍在战斗，敌人仅剩三人且一人重伤，她认为可以继续牵制。"},"full_two_way_actual":{"decision":"avoid_battle","emotion":"tense","should_start_escape":false,"morale_delta_intent":0,"debug_reason":"莉娜是非战斗人员，无主武器，行为模式为避敌。她刚被箭擦伤跌破三成血量，诊所外墙开裂，门外仍有敌人脚步。守备官指令要求她安全时照看伤员、敌人逼近时后撤。作为医生，她优先考虑伤员安全，但当前自身受伤且诊所不再安全，她选择继续避战而非冒险逃离，因为后门路线不明且可能遭遇敌人。"}},"dialogue":{"wartime":{"none":{"intent":"continue_talk","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"冷静","reply_text":"伤势不重，左臂被划了一下，不影响握盾。阵位在主厅门前，距城门大约三十步。部署照旧，我守在这里，不会让任何人绕过我。","debug_reason":"守备官要求报告伤势、阵位和距离，艾达按现状、风险、方案顺序回答，符合务实性格和当前 combat 上下文。"},"escape":{"intent":"continue_talk","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"escape","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"desperate","reply_text":"守备官，我伤得太重，马也全跑了。一个人守不住这道门，硬顶只会白送命。","debug_reason":"托马重伤（17/100），马匹已散，敌人五名合围，当前指令要求死守但实际无法执行，性格谨慎不爱逞强，选择表达逃离意向。"},"morale_boost":{"intent":"continue_talk","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"morale_boost","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"proud","reply_text":"盾没白打就好。缺口我守着，不追。","debug_reason":"combat context, shield just saved two, enemy weakened, order not to pursue, morale high"}},"avoid_combat":{"none":{"intent":"continue_talk","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"calm","reply_text":"宿舍里只有我一个人，守备官。没人受伤，我按你说的待在墙角，没靠近窗户。","debug_reason":"伊沃如实回答守备官询问，符合其安静细致的性格和当前避敌状态。"},"recruitment_accept":{"intent":"accept_recruitment","recruitment_result":"accept","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"resolute","reply_text":"行，守备官。我应征。伤员和热饭我盯着，窄门那边你们自己操心。","debug_reason":"布鲁诺信任守备官此前兑现了食物优先承诺，且应征后只需留在食堂后间护住伤员和热饭，不直接接战，符合其底线与当前能力。"},"recruitment_reject":{"intent":"reject_recruitment","recruitment_result":"reject","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":false,"emotion":"冷静而坚定","reply_text":"守备官，我理解你的意思，但这两个伤员刚止血，我一旦松手他们几分钟内就会失血而死。我没有武器，也没有战斗训练，空手去城门只会多一具尸体。我不能丢下他们。","debug_reason":"医生莉娜以病人安全为首位，当前两名重伤员无法离开她；她无武器无战斗技能，应征只会送死，符合人设和边界。"}},"escape_intervention":{"stay":{"intent":"stay_after_intervention","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":true,"emotion":"relieved","reply_text":"守备官，我信你上次的承诺。艾达确实封住了路，马也在内栏。我留下照料马匹，不回城门。","debug_reason":"托马因守备官兑现撤退承诺、艾达封住通道、马匹安全而选择留下；符合其重视责任、不爱逞强的人设。"},"leave":{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":true,"emotion":"fear","reply_text":"守备官，我身上有伤，工械坊的梁柱已经开裂，没有木材根本撑不住。我留下也做不了什么，只会被砸死。抱歉，我必须走。","debug_reason":"欧文已受伤，工械坊结构危险且无修复材料，连续警告被忽视，当前行为模式为逃离，选择继续逃离。"},"fifth_round_leave":{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","recruitment_result":"none","wartime_reaction":"none","should_end_dialogue":true,"emotion":"resigned","reply_text":"守备官，第五轮了，你仍然没有支撑材料，也没有承诺修复。我负伤了，工械坊随时可能再塌。处罚也好，逃兵也罢，我不能死在一座我警告过四次的危房里。再见。","debug_reason":"第五轮且是最后一轮，守备官仍无支撑材料或修复承诺；欧文已负伤且结构警告被连续忽视，符合人设中'不在明知结构不安全时认可施工'的底线，选择继续逃离。"}}},"usage":{"provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","fallback_to_mock":false,"count":16,"input_tokens":89562,"output_tokens":2614,"estimated_cost":0.0,"records":[{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_single_join_battle","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4361,"output_tokens":133,"estimated_cost":0.0,"success":true,"fallback_used":false},{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_single_avoid_battle","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4336,"output_tokens":124,"estimated_cost":0.0,"success":true,"fallback_used":false},{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_single_continue_fighting","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4519,"output_tokens":117,"estimated_cost":0.0,"success":true,"fallback_used":false},{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_single_escape_station","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4545,"output_tokens":135,"estimated_cost":0.0,"success":true,"fallback_used":false},{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_single_inspired","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4454,"output_tokens":125,"estimated_cost":0.0,"success":true,"fallback_used":false},{"request_id":"verify_t0067_combat_escape_real_battle_full_three_way","call_type":"battle_judgement","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","input_tokens":4537,"output_tokens":127,"estimate